        "note": "2,309 rows over 22 pollutants at one day type. Every one of them is bit-identical to the same row of `chain-so2-co2e-mechanism`'s 2,767, which is what makes this a control: the reference is the same numbers with five pollutants removed. The blocks are 125 cohorts wide for Total Energy, 124 for THC and N2O, 104 for everything chained through a ratio table with no electricity row, and 64 for ethanol, whose ratio covers only the two gasoline fuels.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
