        "note": "20 rows: fourteen hang a toxic off VOC's 8701, and six build the hydrocarbon ladder and TOG's fan-in (101 to 7901 to 8001, 501 off 101, 8701 off 7901, and 8601 from BOTH 501 and 8001). The twenty-first row the sibling has is absent -- SO2's 3101 off Total Energy's 9101 -- and its absence is the whole of the difference this table makes.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
